"description":"Fall asleep easier, release anxiety, calm racing thoughts, and stay focused with science-backed sound therapy.\n\nExplore immersive binaural soundscapes, featuring:\n- Delta, Theta, Alpha, Beta, & Gamma (40 Hz) brainwave binaural beats\n- 432 Hz, 528 Hz, & other Solfeggio music\n- Pure binaural & isochronic tones\n- White, brown, green, & pink noise\n- Rain sounds\n- Ocean waves\n- Night ambience\n- Calming music\n\n100% VERIFIED BINAURAL BEATS\n“After having used Binaurals over the past few years, I can tell which ones are good and which ones aren’t or are total fake. These are by far the best.” –User review\n\nWe analyzed hundreds of the top streamed binaural beats and found that **most don’t even contain the frequencies they claim to provide**, while many make false, even dangerous claims. Moongate only offers authentic binaural beats, verified through audio analysis and backed by research.\n\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR EXPERIENCE\n“On Moongate you can actually hear the frequencies and control them. It feels way more effective and less sketchy.” –User review\n\nUnlike other apps and websites, Moongate lets you adjust the intensity of the active frequencies in each soundscape.\n\nWith Backdrop mode, you can even play Moongate while listening to other apps, like podcasts, audiobooks, and meditations.\n\nEasily access your top soundscapes with Favorites and Playlists.\n\nSeamlessly integrate Moongate into your routines with Timers, perfect for sleep, meditations, or work sessions.\n\nDELTA + THETA (0.1-4 Hz): Fall Asleep Faster, and Stay Asleep Longer\n“My sleep has improved dramatically since using this app!” –User review\n\nIf you suffer from insomnia or have racing thoughts at night, Moongate can help. Studies show binaural beats can promote faster sleep onset, fewer wake ups, and enhanced sleep quality.\n\nGAMMA + BETA (14-100 Hz): Boost Concentration\n“Moongate has been a game-changer for my focus” –User review\n\nIf you struggle with procrastination or have trouble staying on task, our soundscapes can shift your mind to a more focused, productive state. For example, 40 Hz Gamma binaural beats have been shown in studies to improve attention and working memory.\n\nTHETA + ALPHA (4-14 Hz): Release Stress and Anxiety\n“I’ve noticed a change in my ability to relax even when I’m not using them.” –User review\n\nMoongate’s Theta and Alpha frequency soundscapes help guide the mind to a state of peace and relaxation. Studies have shown binaural beats can relieve anxiety, reduce stress, and improve overall mood.\n\nTHETA + ALPHA, continued: Enhance Meditation\n“This app has rich binaural beats that have helped with my meditation practice and sleeping tremendously” –User review\n\nAlpha brainwaves manifest during light meditation, while Theta brainwaves are present during the deepest meditative states. By inducing these brainwave patterns, binaural beats can facilitate more effective meditation sessions.\n\nHEALING FREQUENCIES (432 Hz, 528 Hz, etc): Sound Healing and Spirituality\n“10/10 would recommend for meditating, refocusing and rejuvenating your mind, body, and soul.” –User review\n\nMoongate offers a range of frequencies commonly used in spiritual practices:\n- 432 Hz, renowned for its pleasing, relaxing effects\n- 528 Hz, used in many applications, including relaxation and spiritual transformation\n- 396 Hz, for meditations focused on releasing guilt, fear, and other negative emotions\n- 417 Hz, symbolizing change and overcoming negativity\n- 639 Hz, for mindfulness around healthy relationships, empathy, and compassion\n- 741 Hz, often used for spiritual cleansing and renewal\n- 852 Hz, associated with intuition and spiritual connection with the universe\n\nSTART YOUR JOURNEY TODAY\n“I have used 20 different sound/meditation apps and I find these binaural beats to be the best!” –User review\n\nStep through the Moongate, and experience the difference for yourself. Your journey to better mental health begins now.\n\nTerms 