"description":"ASMRix is a multifunctional sound application that maintains an immersive auditory experience. It maintains decompression and relaxation, creating a rich and diverse world of sound effects for users. The application collects a vast number of high-quality sound effects, including chewing sounds, page turning sounds, whispering in the ear, wooden sounds, packaging opening, instrument performance, fingertips tapping, pen pen sounds, and various classic ASMR sound effects. All audio is carefully selected and tuned, with fine and soft sound quality that can effectively relieve emotions and release stress.\nThe software interface is simple and intuitive, easy to use, supports custom classification management and sound collection bookmarks, making it easy for users to quickly find their favorite sound effects. At the same time, the application supports local audio import, continuously expanding the auditory content. Built-in professional recording features allow users to capture distinctive sounds around them at any time. Users can also edit recording covers, clean up idle audio, and create their own sound library, making every listening experience full of personalized novelty.", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "minimumOsVersion":"15.6", "averageUserRating":4.666669999999999873807610129006206989288330078125, "trackCensoredName":"ASMRix-Immerse Sound Therapy", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/asmrix-immerse-sound-therapy/id6782830581?uo=4", "primaryGenreName":"Entertainment", "primaryGenreId":6016, "userRatingCount":51}, 
