"description":"Discover Serenity with eMus. eMus is a cutting-edge app crafted for fans of white noise and offline music. \nRelish your favorite sounds anytime, anywhere, without requiring an internet connection. \nEscape the bounds of online restrictions and dive into the offline music experience.\n\nStandout Features:\nDecibel Meter: Track noise around you.\nImproving Sleep Quality: White noise can mask environmental noises, helping people fall asleep more easily and maintain deep sleep.\nRelaxation and Stress Reduction: White noise helps relax the mind and body, reducing stress and anxiety, making it suitable for activities like meditation or yoga.\nListen Anywhere: Relax and enjoy your favorite tunes without an internet connection. eMus allows you to rediscover the joy of offline listening.\nImport Local Music: Access and play your favorite songs and audio files directly from your device.\nBlend Music with White Noise: Boost your relaxation and concentration by integrating white noise with your music. Seamlessly mix tracks to create a unique ambiance of calm and melody, suitable for any setting.\nCreating a Work Atmosphere: For those who need to create or think, white noise can help establish a quiet, focused atmosphere.\nWooden Fish: Relaxation for stress. eMus simplifies offline music enjoyment, adding more comfort to your everyday life.\n\nThe VIP Items and Price：\n$1.49 per week: VIP eMus Weekly\n$14.99 per year: VIP eMus Yearly\n$24.99 for lifetime: eMus VIP Lifetime\n\nIf you subscribe via iTunes: Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of the purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period at the rate of the selected plan. Subscriptions and auto-renewal may be managed by going to Account Settings after purchase.\n\nTerms of Use: https://sites.google.com/view/emus-terms-of-use/home\nPrivacy Policy:https://sites.google.com/view/emus-privacy-policy/home\nContact:developer555888@163.com\n\neMus simplifies offline music enjoyment, adding more comfort to your everyday life.", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "minimumOsVersion":"14.0", "averageUserRating":4.56615000000000037516656448133289813995361328125, "trackCensoredName":"eMus: Sound Music Player", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/emus-sound-music-player/id6529545624?uo=4", "primaryGenreName":"Music", "primaryGenreId":6011, "userRatingCount":3220}, 
