"description":"Discover the power of music therapy today. Music Healing will help you.\n\nNo other sense has the impact of sound. What you hear can change your life — the way you sleep, wake up, and think. Change what you listen to and notice a change in everything else.\n\n\"Research has shown that music has a profound effect on your body and psyche.\" - verywellmind.com/how-and-why-music-therapy-is-effective-3145190\n\nUse Music Healing when you are in stressful and intense situations, when you're winding down for the night, or when you just need to relax and get away.\n\nFEATURES\n\n• Tons of soothing musical pieces, written and produced exclusively for Music Healing\n• Layer in relaxing sounds over the music, each with its own volume control\n• Beautiful imagery that fades in and out for a visual escape\n• Video playback of beautiful beach and nature scenes\n• A Sleep Timer gently fades the music out after the time of your choice — drift off without touching your phone\n• A Wake Timer starts your day the right way, fading music in softly at the alarm time\n• Repeat your favorite piece, or let the collection play on\n\nTap anywhere on the screen to bring up the controls — tap again and they slide away, leaving nothing but the scenery and the sound.\n\nThis app has to be seen and heard in action — download now and enjoy!\n\nXME has written and produced for:\n\nIndia.Arie\n— \"There's Hope\"\n— \"Private Party\"\n— \"Just For Today\"\n— \"She Is\" (film score for \"Iron Ladies\")\n— \"Grains\"\n\nAnthony David\n— \"Words\" (nominated for a Grammy)\n\nCekoya — from BET's Sunday Best\n— \"It's Me\" album\n\n…and now \"Music Healing\" software, exclusively for you!", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "minimumOsVersion":"15.6", "averageUserRating":4.291669999999999873807610129006206989288330078125, "trackCensoredName":"Music Healing", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/music-healing/id301294330?uo=4", "primaryGenreName":"Health & Fitness", "primaryGenreId":6013,